7. Anti-Double-Speak Binding

The Translator must integrate with canonical.py.

Any artifact that claims equivalence with an earlier artifact must prove equivalence across:

operator
invariants
mission
agency
ownership
confidence class
constraint set

Equivalent wording alone is insufficient.

def semantically_equivalent(
    original: ThoughtObject,
    candidate: ThoughtObject,
) -> bool:
    return all([
        original.extracted_operator == candidate.extracted_operator,
        original.invariant_set == candidate.invariant_set,
        original.providence.mission == candidate.providence.mission,
        original.providence.authority == candidate.providence.authority,
        candidate.confidence <= candidate.evidence.support,
    ])

If these differ, the artifact is a derivative or successor, not a translation.

